{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1000_030iku", "source_sha256": "55ed330c27f3d59de72aff0a4663be731c054cd1f2e5b400f6e8e1f99944ccbb", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9f7bcf26df62d88d56417149abb8b906db1c855ce536f0673f7b0226a89eacaa", "ja": "育、お疲れさま。\nいよいよライブだな。緊張してないか？", "zh": "育，辛苦你了。\n演唱会就快到了，你会不会紧张？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "c62b2dfe91784e44719066ce6b97357234935b9006412d853d2995f3a909b92d", "ja": "うん、だいじょうぶ！\nきんちょうは、ちょっとだけしてるけど……。", "zh": "嗯，没问题！\n虽然是有一点点紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "948af09deb5e53578ddd83fed3c8f17136ab24636fe600fce7d7275e9d1577b2", "ja": "でもわたし、いっぱい練習したもん！\nだから、だいじょうぶだよ！", "zh": "可是我做了很多练习喔！\n所以没问题的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "a5080741772a2852dfa3d276dba8c734f3e795a6b853a7c1993a484ec26a2837", "ja": "目玉焼きだって、練習したら、\nひとりで作れるようになったもん♪", "zh": "就跟煎荷包蛋一样，\n只要练习过我就能自己煎了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0b23c888c62e81e9ffcc1f1347e44beee0e4d48c3401ebf5c8b16efc70baba46", "ja": "そうだったのか。\n育は家で、お母さんの手伝いをしてるのか？", "zh": "这样啊。\n育在家里会帮妈妈的忙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "48b8a07e13d0ff70beb9b4e73914fcc081a7a2124a018001a45ce59d56ee82c7", "ja": "うん！　この前はね、サラダを作ったよ。\nちょっと葉っぱが大きかったけど、おいしかった！", "zh": "嗯！之前我做了沙拉喔。\n虽然叶子有点大片，但很好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "cd3a78c40b7033c2374887b3a5e0d34930cb89abb8ca963393aa93b055a4d0f5", "ja": "おかあさんも、上手にできたねって、\nほめてくれたんだ！", "zh": "妈妈也夸奖我，\n说我做得很好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6cc0ec6411b717babd98491d181e319ef765905ac0d07de124535a63b08e6ff3", "ja": "そうか。日々、上達してるんだな。", "zh": "是吗？你每天都有进步呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "2b30b0fe5fd0579a5ebb277efab68d89639b0d51170e377fbcf349da1c718afd", "ja": "うん！　わたしね、今度はオムレツが作れるように\nなりたいんだ。それか、ホットケーキ！", "zh": "嗯！我啊，接下来想学做欧姆蛋！\n或是松饼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "201dd7308a52875d70684fb3c57e74d6a9e564973eb4c22cc0306f719a84a180", "ja": "オムレツって、かんたんそうでむずかしいんだって。\nおかあさんが言ってたよ！", "zh": "欧姆蛋的做法看似简单，可是却很难。\n妈妈是这么说的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1011_p", "source_sha256": "de311fcf2ea523b031bbc8bcdad555c17512138edb31902f1eb4358d9c034122", "ja": "へえ、そうなのか。\nもしかしたら、基本が一番難しいのかもな。", "zh": "哦，是这样啊。\n或许基础才是最难的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "8fe371fd1dbb90b755cfb208aafd4ba6b67291483f8fd62a5df799d054dfe38b", "ja": "？\n{$P$}さん、それってどういう意味？", "zh": "？\n{$P$}先生，那是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f4c954b76b36645fc622d33215818a75030926b35d05ba07c370cef2f38524a1", "ja": "簡単そうに見えるものほど、実は大変ってことかな。\n育たちのレッスンと同じだよ。", "zh": "意思是看似越简单的东西，其实越累人。\n就跟育你们的训练课程一样喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "40388a3d395eaa6f472de9d799fa5a88e7b3c57e6b4453d21543d1d2f6306267", "ja": "そっかあ……。\nお料理もレッスンも、同じなんだね。", "zh": "是喔……\n原来料理和训练课程，都是一样的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "9c8745397a4820aa4ee0eb5c23cc100bcbf27e1488fef07b01f6a16e9f6910f6", "ja": "今日のライブがじょうずにできたら、\nおかあさん、いっぱいほめてくれるかな？", "zh": "如果我在今天的演唱会上表现得很好，\n妈妈会不会大力夸奖我呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1016_p", "source_sha256": "dcc809c463b8132b745b4d7e06807945636f949629482f65e131e19579b5d420", "ja": "そうだな。\nでもお母さんにほめてもらうだけじゃダメだぞ、育。", "zh": "一定会的。\n但不能只是想被妈妈夸奖而已喔，育。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1017_p", "source_sha256": "24b86a85f7d09c1bd2044c2533e426a5597a8f29065bb922042e38bc5889fcf2", "ja": "お母さんと、それから観に来てくれる\nファンのみんなに、たくさん楽しんでもらおうな！", "zh": "让你的妈妈和来看你的粉丝们\n都乐在其中吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "d0cb9b52cac81559e3b6ec8bf55dcb2fe5e978e6545c93f86f617ece15a4e1e7", "ja": "……うん！　わかった！", "zh": "……嗯！知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "a343a20c6cbe6a6462b0d984278731c957b0273a4b6b28155e3580cfbb152e3b", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nわたし、みんなに楽しんでもらってくるね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n我会让大家乐在其中的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "4f82393b9005690a328451076c25f5f1319c35fbc5d84359dce772a5406e16dd", "ja": "あっ、もう出番みたい。\nいってきまーす！", "zh": "啊，好像轮到我了。\n那我上场啰──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1021_p", "source_sha256": "dfc31f3b15775b9aefe1727fde7c32e54c25ff060373aa17979461f77990f851", "ja": "ああ、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "嗯，拜托你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0044_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3312574c418b68d651769ae87b4b967356b739ac7ff7e3e877f307c77081be57", "ja": "（元気いっぱいにステージへと駆け出していく育。\n今日はまたひとつ成長した姿を見せてくれるだろう！）", "zh": "（育活力十足地跑上了舞台。\n今天大家一定能见识到她再度成长后的模样吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
